---
// src/components/ProblemSection.astro
---

<section class="py-24 relative border-t border-white/[0.06] bg-[#080b16]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Heading & Copy (Section 11) -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 font-mono">The Traditional Diligence Problem</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white font-heading tracking-tight mt-3">
        Due diligence shouldn't take forever.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Due diligence is critical—but the process is often fragmented across documents, spreadsheets, emails, experts and disconnected workflows.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 5 Pain Points Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- 01 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-7 border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/30 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-indigo-400">01</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs">Repository Chaos</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Information Fragmentation</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Important documents live across multiple systems, Google Drive folders, WhatsApp chats, and disconnected email attachments.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
          Result: Missing schedules & lost versions
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-7 border border-white/5 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-400">02</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs">Specialist Silos</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Expert Coordination</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Different specialists work across different workstreams—CAs, lawyers, CS professionals, and technical valuers reviewing in isolation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
          Result: Zero cross-domain insight sharing
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 03 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-7 border border-white/5 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-400">03</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs">Thread Nightmare</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Query Chaos</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Questions, responses, and supporting documents become impossible to track across endless email strings and spreadsheets.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
          Result: Unanswered questions delayed to closing
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 04 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-7 border border-white/5 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-400">04</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs">Late Revelations</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Delayed Findings</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Important observations and deal-breaking red flags emerge only after weeks of manual review, right before investment committee signoff.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
          Result: Deal friction & last-minute renegotiations
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 05 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-7 border border-white/5 hover:border-rose-500/30 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-rose-400">05</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs">Consolidation Drag</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Manual Reporting</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Teams spend dozens of valuable billable hours manually consolidating disjointed specialist outputs, copy-pasting tables, and reconciling differing terminology into final reports.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
          Result: Diluted insights and slowed transaction momentum
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Section 12: Transition Statement -->
    <div class="mt-20 pt-16 border-t border-white/[0.08] text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 font-mono mb-3 block">The LIFT Transformation</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white font-heading tracking-tight leading-tight">
        LIFT connects the process.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-xl text-slate-300 font-medium">
        One structured environment for the entire diligence journey.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
        Less chasing. Less fragmentation. Less waiting. More clarity.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
